# Documentation sync (ecommerce-platform)

When your work changes something documented here, **update the matching doc in the same task** — do not wait to be asked.

## When to update what

| You changed                                                | Update (same task)                                                                           |
| ---------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Monorepo layout, CI, multi-site flow, integration maturity | `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`                                                                       |
| HTTP routes, admin pages, storefront production routes     | `docs/ROUTES.md`                                                                             |
| Naming, UI stacks, patterns, tooling                       | `docs/CONVENTIONS.md`                                                                        |
| Deployed sites (DB, GCS, URLs, features)                   | `docs/site-registry.json` (features must match `packages/site-config/src/sites/*.ts`)        |
| OpenAPI / Orval pipeline details                           | `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` § API contract                                                        |
| Storefront-specific patterns (tabs, modals, Zustand)       | `docs/CONVENTIONS.md` + `client/.cursor/rules/*.mdc`                                         |
| Admin-specific patterns (nav, tokens)                      | `docs/CONVENTIONS.md` + `.cursor/rules/admin-ui.mdc`                                         |
| API contract rules                                         | `.cursor/rules/api-contract.mdc`                                                             |
| Site config / new sites                                    | `.cursor/rules/multi-site.mdc`                                                               |
| Human quick start                                          | `README.md`                                                                                  |
| Workspace README scope                                     | `client/README.md`, `admin/README.md`                                                        |
| Agent entry commands or doc map                            | `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, `GEMINI.md`, `.github/copilot-instructions.md`, `docs/AI-INDEX.md` |
| API roadmap / planned endpoints                            | `client/backend_features_analysis.md` (keep status header accurate)                          |

## How

1. Edit the smallest section that reflects the change (one table row, one bullet, one subsection).
2. Set **Last reviewed** to today's date in `docs/AI-INDEX.md` for every doc you touch.
3. If a Cursor rule summary is stale, update the matching `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` bullet — keep rules short; long form stays in `docs/`.

## Do not

- Hand-edit `packages/api-client/src/generated/**` — regenerate and document the pipeline instead.
- Document aspirational behavior as current (e.g. feature-flag nav filtering) without noting it is not implemented yet.
